  "steps": [
    "Spread the sugar in a cold oven-safe pan, turn the heat to low and leave it, without stirring, until it melts into a golden caramel.",
    "Whisk in the butter, then the cream (it bubbles up), then the vanilla and salt.",
    "Lay the bananas cut-side down in the caramel and simmer 2 minutes.",
    "Cover with the puff pastry, tuck in the edges, prick all over and cut a small hole in the middle.",
    "Bake at 190 °C for 30 minutes.",
    "Shake the pan to loosen the edges and flip onto a plate. Serve with cream and shaved chocolate."
  ]
